# In a 24x8 terminal the Quick Add project picker covers the panel to list the projects, and picking one by arrow adds there.
size 24 8
file <<END
Work:
Home:
END
keys qq
type Water plants
keys <Space> /
see Home
keys <Down> <Enter>
see Quick Add → Home
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Work:
Home:
	- Water plants
END
